      Description: 
      Languages:
      - If you quit now, you will lose <color=#B73333>{[VALUE]} pumpkins</color>!
      - "\uC9C0\uAE08 \uC885\uB8CC\uD558\uBA74 <color=#B73333>{[VALUE]} \uD638\uBC15</color>\uC744
