    - Term: Select a grill to unlock with the Magic Key!
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - Select a grill to unlock with the Magic Key!
      - "\uB9E4\uC9C1 \uD0A4\uB85C \uC7A0\uAE08 \uD574\uC81C\uD560 \uADF8\uB9B4\uC744
        \uC120\uD0DD\uD558\uC138\uC694!"
