    - Term: You will lose and fail !
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - You will lose <color={[color]}>{[X]}</color> and fail <color={[color]}>{[Y]}</color>!
      - "<color={[color]}>{[X]}</color>\uB97C \uC783\uACE0 <color={[color]}>{[Y]}</color>\uC5D0
