    - Term: buy more save more
      TermType: 0
      Description: 
      Languages:
      - buy more, save more
      - "\uB9CE\uC774 \uC0B4\uC218\uB85D \uB354 \uC544\uAEF4\uC694"
      - "\u8CB7\u3048\u3070\u8CB7\u3046\u307B\u3069\u304A\u5F97\uFF01"
      - Mehr kaufen, mehr sparen
      - "Cuanto m\xE1s compras, m\xE1s ahorras"
